		line=1253,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Fuuhh!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"I finish my last practice swing and catch my breath.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"I could hardly walk on my own two feet this morning, but after Kotone's hot spring remedy, my body was as good as new.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"I'm still woefully out of practice, but I'm at least able to run, jump, and swing my blade as well as I used to.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Still, though, I can't believe that lewd ritual actually worked like a charm.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Lewd? Why, I never!”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That was a secret technique that has been sealed away for over three hundred years.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You sure it wasn't sealed away for being too lewd?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, it all makes sense now!”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Kotone claps her hands together in realization.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"You sure you want to accept that?",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, think you can fight the way you did in Tenkyo?”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I'd stand no chance just charging straight into the Republican Army.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"As I am now, I might be able to hold my own in a fight against Akari, but Hotori would easily wipe the floor with me.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I apologize. If only my magicks were more potent...”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've done more than enough, Kotone. He can practice with a blade now, so that's a great start.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Akari gives Kotone a few reassuring pats on the head.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hmm... we still won't get far unless we find a way to unlock Mitsurugi's power, though.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"The three of us sink into silence.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Tenkyo is presently occupied by over sixty thousand Republican soldiers.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"And with the Sworn Blades annihilated, Akari has no forces to call her own.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Her only hope is me... Or rather, Mitsurugi's power within me.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"The same power that preserved the Empire from all calamity for two thousand years─",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Unless we are able to unlock that power, we'll never be able to rescue our comrades in Tenkyo or infiltrate the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"It's no exaggeration to say that the fate of the Empire depends on it.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, there is a matter I would like to inquire about.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I have long been told that the Exalt-Priestess's role is to serve Mitsurugi-sama, but what exactly does that entail?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The way I understand it, it's like providing a vehicle with fuel.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Apparently, when Mitsurugi fights, he consumes the reserves of spellforce inside him.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And it's the Exalt-Priestess's job to replenish those reserves.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Is there a method for doing so?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I think there was a certain ritual involved, but I don't know the details.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"In a way, I'm just like a patient who's been operated upon.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"I have no recollection what my surgeon, the Exalt-Priestess, might have done to me.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hmm, if only we knew what that certain ≪something≫ was...”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“≪Something?≫”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah, now that you mention it...”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Chihaya─the first Exalt-Priestess─often called herself\n'Mitsurugi's bride.'”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Akari & Kotone"},
			{
"“Bride?!” “Bride?!”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"The two freeze at the exact same time.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You mean to say the first Exalt-Priestess performed a certain bridey ≪something≫ and called it a ritual?!”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And all alone with him in a room?!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Stop making it sound so sketchy!”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, she didn't do any of the things you're hoping for.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No one's hoping for squat.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She did say she'd offer her body to Mitsurugi, but I'm sure she meant it metaphorically.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Offer her body...”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Kotone crosses her arms in contemplation.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Could my predecessor have offered her body to you as well?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In life, she always mentioned how indebted she was to you.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't remember, but it's entirely possible.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, I am wholly convinced!”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Kotone faces me and straightens her posture.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, I may be most unworthy, but I pray for our everlasting─”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't marry yourself off just like that!”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Worry yourself not, Akari-sama! I am fully resolved to offer up my body and soul.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You serious?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I am resolved!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"She sneaks a glance upwards at my face.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Aaahh... But, but...! N-No, I mustn't!”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, Oomikami! Please forgive my rampant delusions of indecency!”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone! Get a hold of yourself!”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In and out... In and out...”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'Bride' probably has a different meaning, right? Isn't that the most obvious explanation?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“B-But... What then am I to do with all my resolve?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Throw it out with the trash.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Uwaah... There goes my maidenly resolve, trampled like so many flowers...”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Kotone slumps deflatedly.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Anyway, Soujin, try your best to remember what\n'Mitsurugi's bride' really means.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“There surely must have been ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"some",
{"/font"},
" significance to a title like 'Mitsurugi's bride.'”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, no matter what this role may demand of me, rest assured that I shall see it through to the end.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please do not hesitate to tell me everything as soon as you remember.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I promise.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Kotone's resolve is nothing to be trifled with.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Seeing it serves as a stark reminder that I ought to steel my own resolve as well.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"As Akari watches our exchange, an anxious expression slowly crosses over her face.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"She turns around, walking several steps away before calling out to me.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, we need to talk, so come by my room later.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Heeding my lord's summons, I arrive at Akari's room.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"I kneel before her, awaiting her command.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"But Akari remains steadfastly silent, refusing to even make eye contact with me.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is there anything you want me to do?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There is.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Akari turns towards me with a glare.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What should I do?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Make me cry.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"My head is full of question marks.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I asked Kotone about it, and she mentioned that when you passed out in the Warrior District, it might've been because you touched a peach petal.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That was the most shameful display of my life.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah, spare me the self-pity.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But anyways, I thought maybe we could make some progress if you touched one again.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Back then, I saw a vision when I touched that petal of Persica.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Now I understand what it was.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"It was a vision of Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Awakened by that peach petal, fragments of Mitsurugi's memories came flooding back to me.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sounds like it's worth a try.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, you know what to do. Make me cry.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You say that, but...”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We should try everything we can, right?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Until you get your power back, we won't able to go back to Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Guess I have no choice.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Still, what am I supposed to do?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Maybe try cutting an onion in front of me?”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I brought an onion.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“G-Good. Let that onion have it.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"I start dicing the onion right in front of her.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ugh...”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Any luck?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The pain! My eyes are burning!”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Feel any tears coming?”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm trying my best...! But it's not looking likely.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I could try rubbing the onion directly in your eyes?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No way! It hurts just imagining it! Please, anything but that!”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now then, let's try pulling out your hair.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“G-Go ahead...”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"I reach into Akari's hair and pinch a strand between my fingers.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Just start with one, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll try.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ow! That was at least, like, three just now!”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Any tears?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nope.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Maybe we should try the hair right above your temple?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ooh... That already sounds suuuper painful...”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Owww...! That! Freaking! Hurts!”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, do you secretly have a grudge against me or what?!”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But I'm simply carrying out your orders to make you cry. If you want me to stop, I'll stop.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haah... Hearing that made me wanna cry more than anything else.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Now what's she on about?",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Here, I twisted some paper into a string.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"I hand Akari the twisted tissue paper.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's this for?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Stick it up your nose and tickle yourself. If you make yourself sneeze a bunch, you should tear up as well.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...I have to do it myself?”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Would you rather I do it?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Akari turns around without another objection.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“D-Don't look, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Go ahead and have at it.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"I politely avert my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hah... Ahh, nnngh...! Ah─ah... achoo!”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"After a few seconds, I hear a cute sneeze from behind me.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Any luck?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Not even a little...”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Didn't you once say you were a big crybaby?”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"The tissue paper is lying in a crumpled heap on the ground, its life ambitions sadly unfulfilled.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I just don't think physical stimulation is gonna work.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're saying we should try psychological stimulation instead?”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Suddenly there's a lot more ways this could go wrong.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, try acting really mean towards me.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll do it, but don't hate me for it later.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I know.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Does she really?",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Okay, here I go.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Give me your best shot.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, you are a fool.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nh...”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're ugly, and stupid, and nobody could love your face.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nnnggh...”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're stubborn as hell and refuse good advice when it's staring you in the face, and I've met plenty of little kids more mature than you.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Grrrnnnghh!”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How's that?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm fuming!”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Feel like crying?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Like hell I could cry at that!”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Her Imperial drawers appear to be in a twist.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm trying my best here. What else am I supposed to do?”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Like, you know, try to hurt my feelings more!”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Because this wasn't hard enough already.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, I've hated you since the day we met.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Always ordering me around and asking for the impossible, just who do you think you are?”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nnh...”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Akari is at a loss for words.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did that work?”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-I take it back. That's off-limits.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Never have I felt more awkward.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"I try everything I can think of, but all my efforts end in vain.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, what's next?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why don't we just call it here?”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even though it might get you your power back?”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Still, your tears are, well...”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't describe it properly, but well... to me, they feel somehow sacred.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“They're just tears.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You promised me you wouldn't cry anymore. That's the reason they're so precious.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Now that I think about it, both Himi-no-Mikoto and Akari swore to not shed any more tears.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
{"font", size=51},
"Both now and two thousand years in the past, a single girl with endlessly amaranthine eyes and the weight of the world on her shoulders cast aside her tears for the sake of her Empire.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"Even this overlapping of fates surely speaks to the depth of their connection.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Whose promise are you ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"really",
{"/font"},
" thinking of?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mine? Or the Founding Empress's?”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're not talking about Himi-no-Mikoto right now.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You are the person I swore my loyalty to. Why won't you believe me?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I do believe you.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's just...”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"Akari says nothing more.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if I am Mitsurugi on the inside, I refuse to change who I am.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That is to say, I love tofu more than anything!”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...You what?”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if Mitsurugi were a tofu-hater, I would never even consider giving up my own relationship with it.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“O-Oh, okay, I get it.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So can we please put this issue to bed once and for all?”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You were the one who said we should prioritize restoring the Empire above everything else.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In that case, make me cry.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"She got me.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It'll be a hundred years before I let you pull a fast one on me like that.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah... So it seems.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Just tell me one last thing.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What kind of relationship did Mitsurugi and the Founding Empress have?”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I thought I answered this already.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Lord and blade. Is that really all?”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Did Mitsurugi not love the Founding Empress as well?”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"He did.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"But for some reason, I'm hesitant to answer her honestly.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"I don't understand why myself.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi is a mere tool. He could never come to harbor romantic affection for another.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then why did he decide for himself to claim the Founding\nEmpress's life by his own hand?”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't think he would have ever decided that if he didn't love her.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sounds to me like you're starting from the conclusion and working backwards to justify it.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But if you insist on believing it, then go ahead.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So he did love her!”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The whole 'being a tool' thing was just him trying to bottle it up.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi is Mitsurugi. I'm not him.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We of the Myougikan consider 'heart and blade in\nconcord' to be the essence of blade arts.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Only once you cast aside all emotion and become an unthinking blade─that is, a tool─ are you able to attain true mastery.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I wish for nothing more than to become a tool, that I might better serve you, my one and only lord.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If I'm unable to do even that, then I've failed in my duty as a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"I declare with such intensity that even I find it strange.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"It's as though I'm trying to cover up my true feelings for Akari.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I understand.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's test just how good of a tool you really are.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"Akari lays her hands on my shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"She slowly brings her face closer and closer to mine.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wh-What are you─”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Stay right there.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Her breath gently brushes against my face.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you're just a tool, you shouldn't mind this, right?”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari...”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I thought I told you to stop calling yourself a tool.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why must you defy your lord's command?”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nnh?!”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"The distance between us closes to nothing.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nmh... *smooch...*”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"A soft sensation spreads across my lips.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"A faintly intoxicating scent drifts from Akari's hair.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"Before I knew it, the soft swell and delicate curve of Akari's lips had met my own.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well? Do you still feel nothing?!”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Though she releases my shoulders, she continues to peer deeply into my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you're just a tool, you'd probably just think of that as nothing more than touching our lips together.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But if you felt anything just now, anything at all... you\ncan't call yourself a tool.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"Unable to say anything, I simply stare back at Akari.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-What?”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aaaaah, forget it! Come to whatever conclusion you want!”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"Her face stained the same shade as the setting sun, Akari bolts out of the room without another word.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"For some time, I can do nothing but stare at the door she left through.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of all the ridiculous...”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"I whisper to myself as my fingers reach up towards my lips.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"If I'm just a tool, I shouldn't have felt anything at all─",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"But inside me, my heart is hammering out a furious beat, and my head is spinning out of control.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"My duty as a warrior... My fealty to my lord...",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"In a single instant, she laid bare all these impossible contradictions I've been trying to avert my eyes from.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...What in the world is she doing to me?”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"Ah, how long has it been since I last felt ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"this?",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"This dull, rending ache that threatens to twist my heart to pieces.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
